 * Session.getActiveUser() is the pupil. Records live in Script Properties (API.md "Script Properties"). A pupil's view of
 * an act is rebuilt from its seed on every open and mark and never stored, so no key ever leaves this file.
 * The pupil path never touches a Sheet: the archive runs only on the owner's staff visit. */

